+## 5. Postav feature
+
+- Čistá byznys logika → `packages/core/src/<doména>/` s `node:test` testy,
+  konzumuj přes `@won/core/<doména>/…`.
+- Routes → `apps/<tvoje-appka>/app/routes/`.
+- Shopify Functions / extensions → `apps/<tvoje-appka>/extensions/*`.
